   "design": "Saved searches in literature and patent databases ({OTHER}) send new hits on the process topic, so searches are not repeated by hand. Trial conditions and results go into an electronic lab notebook ({DATA_PLATFORM}) with instrument files imported, and standard trial plots are produced from the notebook data instead of spreadsheets. The process description starts from the site's template. Designing and running trials stay with the technician.",
